---
description: Always load AGENTS.md and the nearest nested AGENTS.md for the path being edited
alwaysApply: true
---

Read `AGENTS.md` at the repo root before making any change. When working
inside a subtree that has its own nested `AGENTS.md`
(`apps/backend/AGENTS.md`, `apps/web/AGENTS.md`, `scripts/AGENTS.md`), also
read the nearest one for that subtree. Per the [agents.md](https://agents.md)
spec, more specific (deeper) rules win over less specific ones.

Always also consult `docs/03-decisions.md` for binding architectural
decisions (`DEC-NNN`) and `docs/02-prd.md` for feature tickets (`M{n}-F{nn}`).
